# Expected listening ports inventory
#
# Format:
#   <port>, <proto>, <expected>, <description>
#
# Fields:
#   port       : Port number
#   proto      : tcp or udp
#   expected   : ok (should listen) / ng (should NOT listen) / - (info only)
#   description: Free-text label
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines are skipped.

# ---- SSH ----
22,   tcp, ok, SSH Server

# ---- Web Services ----
80,   tcp, ok, HTTP
443,  tcp, ok, HTTPS

# ---- Database (examples - edit for your environment) ----
# 5432, tcp, ok, PostgreSQL
# 3306, tcp, ok, MySQL
# 1433, tcp, ng, SQL Server (should not be exposed)

# ---- Monitoring ----
# 9090, tcp, ok, Prometheus
# 3000, tcp, ok, Grafana
